Z||000001||Raydar||05-07-2001||09:47 AM||||Cool Site! <BR>The link for the block/crankshaft stuff is broken, though.<P>I've also heard rumors of a "friend of a guy" (can you say "urban legend"?) on alt.autos.fiero using the crank from the GM 4-cylinder marine engine (MerCruiser 140) in a Duke block. Supposedly yields a 3.0 liter displacement. The marine engine is a Chevy block, so I'll believe it when I see it. <P>------------------<BR>Raydar - aka Steve<P>88 black Formula<BR>88 soon-to-be-V6 coupe||||reg||1
